# xterm from Thomas Dickey's release, unchanged, without the Tektronix
# window, graphics and Xft fonts, over NetBSD's terminfo library. Dolly has
# no fork, so xterm runs in its own slave mode (-S): xterm-pty, Dolly's part,
# opens the pseudo-terminal, starts xterm on its master and the shell on its
# slave. It is installed as xterm; upstream's program is /usr/libexec/xterm.
